{"id":"realidad","lemma":"realidad","pos":"noun","rank":255,"glosses":["reality","commodity"],"ipa":"/realiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"realidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-realidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"En realidad tengo que hacerlo.","en":"I actually have to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741223","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"En realidad no puedo hacer nada.","en":"I can't really do anything.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/560101","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"nothing"}]},{"text":"En realidad, nunca lo he visto.","en":"I've actually never seen it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301209","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"never"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"seen"}]},{"text":"En realidad no comprendo esta parte.","en":"I don't really understand this part.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/451527","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,null,null,{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"part"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"I don't understand"]]},{"text":"Nadie sabe en realidad qué está pasando.","en":"No one really knows what's going on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/76998","words":[{"g":"no one"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to pass","l":"pasar"}]}]}